cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "如需在研究中引用本仓库，请使用以下元数据。"
title: "DJI Mini x UE5 x 3DGS: Feasibility Validation and LLM Tool-Call Drone Orchestration"
abstract: >-
  Two-phase technical validation project: (1) DJI Mini aerial capture -> 3D Gaussian Splatting
  reconstruction -> Unreal Engine 5 rendering feasibility; (2) LLM tool-call orchestration of
  drone missions with a deterministic safety validator, simulation backend, UE5 virtual-camera
  mission rendering, and an Android DJI MSDK v5 bridge design.
authors:
  - name: "GAIA Project contributors"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-11-09"
license: "TBD"
keywords:
  - DJI Mini
  - DJI MSDK v5
  - Gaussian Splatting
  - Unreal Engine 5
  - LLM tool calling
  - drone autonomy
  - safety validation
